      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Goddamn it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Super-motherfucking-villain, goddamn it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "About to get these millions, stack this shit",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Yo, his dip tried to tell him",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "\"Ooh, you're like the sun, chasing all of the rain away",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "When you come around, you bring brighter days\"",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "She told him, \"You're the perfect one",
          "rhyme": "On",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "For me and you forever will be\" (Microphone check, one, two, one two, one, two)",
          "rhyme": "ab",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "He told her, \"I will rock this microphone always\"",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AAABCDEFG",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AAAABACDE"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I hold the mic like niggas hold their girls tight",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "But I ain't after her, probably your Acura, pearl white",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "The hooker? Nah, as many times as I done hit it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "To be specific, more times than dimes in a briznick",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "When you broke north, I crashed the barbecue like Riddick",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "At the Garden, true",
          "rhyme": "y",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "That's the god in me, pardon you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Jeepers",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "I was tore back, the ho gained access to my beeper",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Called back my secretary gatekeeper",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Like I ain't peep her, I said, \"Darling, you was stupid though",
          "rhyme": "O",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "You know the supervillain (He is a super), ho\"",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "I had this style ever since I was a child",
          "rhyme": "Old",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "I got this other style I ain't flip in a while",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "It goes, pure scientific intelligence",
          "rhyme": "#s",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "With one point of relevance",
          "rhyme": "#s",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "MCs whose styles need Velamints",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "And once the smoke clear, tell 'em it's",
          "rhyme": "ins",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "The super-motherfucking-villain, nigga came through raw like the elements",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "All ninety-nine, plus one of them",
          "rhyme": "Em",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "And with a flow to pull a fraud nigga file from out in front of him",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "When we with y'all, we had tons of fun",
          "rhyme": "yn",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Me and my duns and them",
          "rhyme": "Em",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "Actual true and living sons of them",
          "rhyme": "Em",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "Dead planets and god-U's",
          "rhyme": "ins",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "Throwing divine rules to come through, we will over charge you's",
          "rhyme": "ins",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "Ooh, and won't feel remorse for shit",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "Except for one time, once I had took my fronts out and lost them shits (Damn)",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "Scientific, going berserk like Red Alert",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "I really went to pick up wiznork for cheddar dirt",
          "rhyme": "9Rt",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "To fund these experiments is where I went",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "Obviously dead bent and spent every red cent",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "To rule you and still drop more jewels than schools do",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "Or even TV news that's designed to fool you (Who?)",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "Yeah, you, who hear the most grimy suggestions",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "From brothers with fly names and ID questions",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "That's a secret like Victoria teddy sets that's edible",
          "rhyme": "ibl",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "Duns not ready yet for the incredible",
          "rhyme": "ibl",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "Team of MCs who broke all fakes who thought they were slaughter-proof",
          "rhyme": "uf",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "Stomping through like North Face waterproof",
          "rhyme": "uf",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "Tat-tat, that's the end of that",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "41",
          "text": "After, hit the bar where baby girl bartender at",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "42",
          "text": "I told her, \"More wine,\" mingling with no single mentions of",
          "rhyme": "Of",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "43",
          "text": "Stay tuned for more spine tingling adventures of—",
          "rhyme": "Of",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
